## Use Cases

### Multi-Account Management
Operate multiple accounts across isolated cloud phones to avoid conflicts and improve operational efficiency.

### Social Media Operations
Manage and automate social media accounts in overseas environments without relying on local devices.

### RPA & Automation Workflows
Automate repetitive mobile actions such as login, navigation, and scheduled tasks using scripts.

### Phone Farm & Device Clusters
Build cloud-based phone farms for large-scale operations without maintaining physical devices.

### Cloud Gaming
Run continuous or idle tasks in stable cloud environments.

### Android App Testing
Test applications across clean Android environments and multiple system versions.

